{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "読みに来てくださりありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 四期生 山田桃実(やまだももみ)です~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Sakurazaka46 ARENA TOUR -What's lonesome？-"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "足を運んで下さった方、そして配信を見て下さった方、ありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "香川公演、ほんとに楽しかったなあ\nリハ後には実際にアリーナやスタンドの席に座ってみたり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "意外と近くてびっくりしたー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大好物のうどんも、たくさん頬張りました\n初めて釜玉うどん食べたけど、美味しすぎたよ~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobtDa0U2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "マリノさん！！\n撮りに行こうとしたらニコニコでマリノさんが歩いてきて可愛かったです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ほぼ全公演撮れて！最高です( т т )ありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobZzVlj7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まつりさん！\n大大大好きなキャプテンですー！\nいつもMCのまつりさんの言葉を噛み締めながら聞いていました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobh92cyH.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "キラさん\n指を掴んでそうで掴んでないとこ、キラさんらしいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mob4CUgh0.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いとはさん！\n着替え場が近くでよく一緒に笑いました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobmQQooU.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ういさん\n「キスが苦い」の“急ぎすぎだと誰かに言われた”\nあそこ、大好き！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobN7WYcy.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "NEO愛桜宣言\nホテルの部屋が同じで、面白かったです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobqzJUP4.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わこ\n私はわこのアイドル前髪が好きです\nハーフツインも最強ですね❤️‍🔥"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobJj6Ndl.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一緒にうどん食べて、一緒に食べ物をキープしました\nたのしかったですね！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "香川公演はリピート配信もあります~！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "9月14日(月)・9月15日(火)両日とも19:00開場、20:00開演となります！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みましょー🙌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日から9月ということで！\n何か新しいことでも始めてみようかな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後までブログを読んでくださりありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また来てね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "山田桃実"}], "source": "official"}